          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi biatangila muakuidi ne miosa mitoke tô kayenaku, ne disama kadiena dibuela mu munyinyi wa mubidi, nunku muakuidi neamubueshe ha nkayandi mu nsubu matuku muanda mutekete, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bikala disama ditampakane mu dikoba, nunku muakuidi neambile bantu ne, Muntu eu kena muakane edi ndisama dia nsudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi bikala ditoba ditoke tô dishale mu muaba wadi, kadiyi ditampakane, etshi ntshibangu tshia tshima, ne muakuidi neambile bantu ne, Muntu eu udi muakane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
