          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bikala muntu mudioshe ne kahia, ne bikala munyinyi wa mu muaba muandamuke mutoke anyi mukunze, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muakuidi neatangile ha muaba au, ne bikala miosa ya mu muaba au miandamuke mitoke tô, ne bikala disama dimane kubuela mu munyinyi wa mubidi, edi ndisama dia nsudi diakumueneka mu muaba wakadiosheye muakuidi neambile bantu ne, Muntu eu kena muakane edi ndisama dia nsudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biatangila muakuidi ne miosa mitoke tô kayena mu muaba au mutoke, ne disama kadiena dibuela mu munyinyi wa mubidi, muakuidi neamubueshe ha nkayandi mu nsubu matuku muanda mutekete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halua dituku dia muanda mutekete, muakuidi neamutangile ne bikala disama ditampakane mu dikoba muakuidi neambile bantu ne, Muntu eu kena muakane edi ndisama dia nsudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bishala ditoba ditoke mu muaba umue, kadiyi ditampakane mu dikoba, etshi ntshiuja tshiakadiosheye ne kahia, ne muakuidi neambile bantu ne, Muntu eu udi muakane, etshi ntshibangu tshia kahia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
