              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muakuidi neamutangile, ne bikala tshiuja etshi tshitoke tô ku mutu kua muena dibala, anyi ha mpala hadi dibala, bu nsudi udi umueneka mu dikoba diandi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.43",
