          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye neoshe tshilulu mu kahia, bikala disama mu milongo ya buludi anyi mu milongo ya butshiama ya bintu biakenzabo ne miosa ya mikoko anyi bia lin anyi tshintu tshia tshiseba, edi ndisama dia nsudi, neboshe tshintu atshi mu kahia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.52"
