        },
        {
          "text": "Hashikishabo kuvuwa tshintu atshi, muakuidi neatangile ne ditoba dia disama kadiyi diandamuke mekala, nansha bikaladi kadiyi ditampakane, tshintu atshi katshiena tshiakane, nebatshioshe mu kahia edi ndisama dia nsudi, bikala disama ku mutu kua muena dibala anyi ku mpala hadi dibala.",
