        {
          "text": "Biatangila muakuidi ne disama diakuamba kushika hashikishabo kuvuwa tshintu atshi, yeye neahande tshituha tshia tshilulu anyi tshia tshiseba anyi tshia milongo ya buludi anyi tshia milongo ya butshiama tshidi ne disama. ",
