              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bikala disama dishale mu tshilulu nansha mu milongo ya buludi nansha mu milongo ya butshiama anyi mu tshintu tshia tshiseba, disama edi didi ditampakana, neboshe tshintu atshi mu kahia. ",
